Source landscape: the documentary universe is broad but uneven. The highest-yield clusters are 2018-2025 conflict, rights, peace, and political-transition analyses; Abiy-authored Medemer texts and translations; memoir/reportage books; UN, NGO, and think-tank country reports; and a smaller but useful layer of academic articles, chapters, and theses. 2023 target-period material is abundant, but many of the best leads are catalog-only, preview-only, or paywalled, so I preserved them as discovery candidates.

